('alict_01015', 4, 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 'Visited links stay the same color despite this CSS code. fuu CSS (Visited) ine¢ tlu j¾Kfhka { } What''s the privacy-related reason?', '["Modern browsers restrict :visited styles for security", "The CSS is in the wrong order", "Use !important", "The link lacks href", "Cache needs clearing"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Modern browsers limit styling of :visited links to prevent history sniffing attacks. Attackers could use different styles to detect which links a user has visited', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Computer Systems & Architecture', NULL, 1015, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
