('alict_01027', 4, 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 'Which of the following is a characteristic of a multi-user operating system?', '["Supports only one user at a time", "Allows multiple users to use the system simultaneously", "Runs on a single-core processor. tal-yr ilikhla", "Does not support networking", "Uses only command-line interface"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Multi-user operating systems are designed to allow multiple users to access and use the system at the same time. This characteristic is common in systems like Linux and Windows Server', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Computer Systems & Architecture', NULL, 1027, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01028', 4, 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 'Which generation of computers do the above statements refer u.ska w¾: olajkq ,nkafka o? • Faster and Used magnetic cores for the primary memory and magnetic and disks for the yr Consumes lesser electricity and does not wvqfjka wjuhs'' Answer : 2) The statements refer to the Second Generation of computers. m%ldYhka fojk .ek lrhs'' Let''s analyze the given statements one by tlska tl lruq( Faster and reliable', '["First", "Second fojk", "Third", "Fourth", "Fifth miajk 2"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "First". This reflects how this hardware component/device is defined and used in a standard computer system.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Computer Systems & Architecture', NULL, 1028, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01029', 4, 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 'Which of the following is not true about interpreters?', '["It translates program line by into machine code. th", "Program execution is relatively slow as analysis takes place every time the program runs. jevigyk", "It reads the source codes and generates an executable file. th m%Nj", "Programs analyzed by interpreters are easier to debug", "CPU utilization is relatively less. CPU"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Option 1: True. Interpreters work by reading and executing the source code line by line. This means that each line of code is converted into machine code and executed immediately before moving on to the next line. woyia lrkafka Option 2: True', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Computer Systems & Architecture', NULL, 1029, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
