('alict_01042', 9, 'Data Communication & Networking', 'is a coordinated attack against your network security when someone', '["B\u0305 + CA", "C\u0305 + BA", "C + B\u0305A", "B + CA\u0305", "C + B\u0305A\u0305 A. C B\u0305"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "C + B̅A". This follows from standard networking concepts (protocols, topologies, or the OSI/TCP-IP model).', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Data Communication & Networking', NULL, 1042, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01043', 9, 'Data Communication & Networking', 'Which of the following statements about ICT security threats is incorrect?', '["Phishing attacks aim to steal sensitive information by impersonating trusted entities", "A firewall helps prevent unauthorized access to a network. .sksmjqrla", "Ransomware encrypts data and demands payment for its release", "Malware can only spread through email attachments", "Social engineering manipulates individuals to disclose confidential data. iudc"]'::jsonb, 4, 'Option 1: This is correct. Phishing is a common cyber threat where attackers send fake emails or messages pretending to be legitimate organizations to trick victims into revealing credit card or other private data. Option 2: This is correct', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Data Communication & Networking', NULL, 1043, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01044', 9, 'Data Communication & Networking', 'Which of the following ports provides the highest data transfer rate and supports simultaneous power delivery and video output?', '["USB 2.0", "HDMI", "Thunderbolt 3", "VGA", "Ethernet"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Option 1: USB 2.0 is an older standard for data transfer with a maximum speed of 480 It supports basic power delivery but does not support video output or very high data transfer rates compared to newer technologies. USB 2', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Data Communication & Networking', NULL, 1044, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01045', 9, 'Data Communication & Networking', 'Which of the following wireless communication technologies is NOT commonly utilized for establishing ad-hoc networks in mobile computing', '["Bluetooth", "Zigbee", "RFID", "NFC", "Wi-Fi Direct 2025"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "Bluetooth". This follows from standard networking concepts (protocols, topologies, or the OSI/TCP-IP model).', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Data Communication & Networking', NULL, 1045, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01046', 9, 'Data Communication & Networking', 'Which of the following methods is the most economical and secure for the transmission of private and confidential messages and documents between company employees?', '["Email", "Social Network", "Web blog", "Internet call", "Teleconferencing"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "Email". This follows from standard networking concepts (protocols, topologies, or the OSI/TCP-IP model).', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Data Communication & Networking', NULL, 1046, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01047', 9, 'Data Communication & Networking', 'Which of the following is not a characteristic of cloud computing?', '["Elasticity", "On-demand self-service", "Limited accessibility", "Broad network access", "Resource pooling"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Elasticity is a fundamental characteristic of cloud computing. It refers to the ability to scale resources up or down dynamically based on demand. This means users can increase or decrease their computing resources as often automatically', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Data Communication & Networking', NULL, 1047, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01048', 9, 'Data Communication & Networking', 'The technology that allows the transmission of voice and video through a computer or other wireless enabled device without being connected to a fixed physical connection is', '["As the cloud concept", "As mobile audit", "As a telecommunication", "Like video conferencing", "As the universal audit"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "As a telecommunication". This follows from standard networking concepts (protocols, topologies, or the OSI/TCP-IP model).', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Data Communication & Networking', NULL, 1048, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01049', 9, 'Data Communication & Networking', 'is a coordinated attack against your network security when someone', '["Repudiation", "Tampering", "Spoofing", "Phishing", "Hacking Threat getting away with a crime by denying they did even if they did. This makes it hard to prove who''s responsible for cyberattacks. wmrdOhla ;uka th nj ksid ihsn\u00be ljqrekao hkak Tmamq of unauthorized modification of data or wkjirfhka attack against your network security when someone"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "Spoofing". This follows from standard networking concepts (protocols, topologies, or the OSI/TCP-IP model).', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Data Communication & Networking', NULL, 1049, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01050', 9, 'Data Communication & Networking', 'Match What is the primary function of a NIC (Network Interface Card) in an ICT system?', '["Encrypting data for cybersecurity", "Translating programming languages into machine code", "Connecting a computer to a network", "Managing memory allocation for programs", "Assigning IP addresses to networking devices"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Option 1: Incorrect. Encryption is handled by security protocols SSL (Trusted Platform Modules). yiqrejkq ,nkafka SSL Option 2: Incorrect. This is done by compilers or interpreters. Option 3: Correct', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Data Communication & Networking', NULL, 1050, 'A/L Past Paper Series')
