('alict_01263', 7, 'Database Management Systems', 'A <video> tag with autoplay works on desktop but not on mobile. What''s the hidden culprit? iajhxl%Sh jdokh <video> desktop tfla cx.u je', '["Missing muted attribute", "Browser doesn''t support MP4", "Video file is corrupted", "Add playsinline attribute", "Use poster attribute"]'::jsonb, 1, 'On mobile most browsers block autoplay for videos with sound to prevent unwanted data usage and to improve the user experience. To ensure autoplay works on mobile the video must be muted', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Database Management Systems', NULL, 1263, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01264', 7, 'Database Management Systems', 'Which of the following SQL statements will change all occurrences of to in the attribute of the CUSTOMER table?', '["UPDATE CUSTOMER SET City = WHERE City =", "MODIFY CUSTOMER SET City = WHERE City =", "UPDATE CUSTOMER SET City = INTO City =", "UPDATE CUSTOMER CHANGE City = TO", "UPDATE CUSTOMER SET City = WHERE City !="]'::jsonb, 1, 'This statement correctly uses the SQL UPDATE command to modify existing records in a table. The SET clause specifies the new value to be assigned to the City while the WHERE clause ensures that only records with City equal to are updated', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Database Management Systems', NULL, 1264, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
