('alict_01267', 7, 'Database Management Systems', 'Consider the following relations from a database used to manage a library iuqodhlska Publisher_phone) Which of the following is NOT a foreign key in this schema?', '["Book_id in the LOAN relation", "Book_id in the BOOK relation", "Member_id in the LOAN relation", "Publisher_id in the BOOK relation", "Publisher_id in the PUBLISHER relation"]'::jsonb, 2, 'A foreign key is an attribute that references the primary key of another table. In the BOOK Book_id uniquely identifies each book and acts as the primary not a foreign key. Since it does not reference another it cannot be considered a foreign key', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Database Management Systems', NULL, 1267, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_01268', 7, 'Database Management Systems', 'Which attribute in an element associates it with a specific CSS style sheet?', '["class", "id", "rel", "style", "href"]'::jsonb, 3, 'In the "rel" attribute is used to specify the relationship between the current document and the linked resource. When linking to a CSS setting "rel" to "stylesheet" associates the document with that CSS allowing it to style the content. oekg "rel"', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Database Management Systems', NULL, 1268, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
