('alict_01310', 7, 'Database Management Systems', 'What is happening with this SQL Query?', '["Selects all employees whose last name start with ''S''. last name", "Selects all employees whose last name contain ''S''. last name", "Selects all employees whose last name end with ''S''. last name", "Selects all employees whose last name are exactly ''S''. last name fiajlhska", "None of the above"]'::jsonb, 1, 'SELECT * FROM employees WHERE last_name LIKE Uses the LIKE operator with the pattern ''S%''. In the LIKE operator is used to search for a specified pattern in a column. ''S%'' LIKE fufyhjkh The pattern ''S%'' has a specific meaning', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Database Management Systems', NULL, 1310, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
