('alict_01432', 3, 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', 'Given the Boolean expression (A⨁B) + (C. A̅̅̅̅̅̅), and if inputs A = 0 and B = 0, what are the possible outputs based on different values of C?', '["A only. A", "B only. B", "C only. C", "A and B only. A B", "A and C only. A C"]'::jsonb, 2, 'By building a truth table for all possible values of and we can easily determine the outputs corresponding to different instances. B C A B C A⨁B (C. A̅̅̅̅̅̅) (A⨁B) + (C', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Digital Electronics & Logic Circuits', NULL, 1432, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
